# Payment System & Checkout - Test Scenarios

## Prerequisites
1. Make sure you have a valid JWT token from login
2. Make sure you have existing data: jadwal, kursi, tipe_hari, metode_pembayaran

---

## Test 1: Create Order with Multiple Tickets

### Create Order (POST /api/payment/order)
POST http://localhost:3000/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwiZW1haWwiOiJ1c2VyMUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc2ODYxNzMxMywiZXhwIjoxNzY5MjIyMTEzfQ.9L24Z69P6qPtXRrDtORJ78qHrTx_or05qkpJkiEV7Ng
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 4,
      "id_kursi": 8,
      "id_tipe_hari": 1
    },
    {
      "id_jadwal": 4,
      "id_kursi": 9,
      "id_tipe_hari": 1
    }
  ]
}


